"app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "202656016", "author": {"steamid": "76561198118446924", "personaname": "Lau7arox", "persona_status": "in-game", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/lautaro02/", "num_games_owned": 349, "num_reviews": 18, "playtime_forever": 407, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 347, "last_played": 1756861611, "avatar": "8dfe278c7493b6984540e57ecd57b791df13841e"}, "language": "latam", "review": "Buen juego para jugar con amigos, no es un sucesor espiritual del L4D2 (Turtle Rock Studios la cago diciendo eso y por eso el Hype generado no cumplio con las espectativas de la comunidad) pero tiene ciertos aires, aun asi es como comparar peras con manzanas. Recomendado!", "timestamp_created": 1755876554, "timestamp_updated": 1755876554, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 5, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.569120287895202637", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "202267238", "author": {"steamid": "76561198950528571", "personaname": "TheYellow", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198950528571/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 3, "playtime_forever": 3095, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2976, "last_played": 1756779867, "avatar": "c62543a5e9ed8f48af42b97174dd7e9689093d56"}, "language": "latam", "review": "Muy Bueno", "timestamp_created": 1755367906, "timestamp_updated": 1755367906, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "202170276", "author": {"steamid": "76561198208835512", "personaname": "David karius", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/KariusD/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 14, "playtime_forever": 2933, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 51, "last_played": 1785383004, "avatar": "22a0689b0d268ca3eeecf8f6df0ddb8f609f4703"}, "language": "latam", "review": "me encanta :)", "timestamp_created": 1755251349, "timestamp_updated": 1755251349, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "202018609", "author": {"steamid": "76561198005901103", "personaname": "|=[CHUTEMANIA]=--- Gordo Mosfet", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/disco_eterno/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 64, "playtime_forever": 999, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 999, "last_played": 1730883836, "avatar": "aee5b54801b426c347e83e0e670c6c2d61bb22d1"}, "language": "latam", "review": "Es un título para alguien que no conoce Left 4 Dead pero, considerando el peso que tiene dentro del género de zombies, dudo muchísimo que alguien no conozca, aunque sea las mecánicas básicas. \nDicho esto, cabe resaltar que el juego no es malo, aunque tiene varios puntos en contra:\n\n- Online muerto.\n- La campaña solo con bots es aburridísima\n- Jugarlo con amigos exige bastante tiempo para terminarlo de un tirón\n\nTRS se colgó de las tetas de Left 4 Dead y no le llega a los talones. En consecuencia, pusieron las expectativas muy en alto y el resultado fue un producto con todo lo malo que tuvieron los shooters de la década pasada, demasiadas cosas al pedo y el bendito sistema de cartas que se convirtió mas en un instulto a la simpleza que en una proésa de jugabilidad y que terminó por enterrarlo. Injustificado el precio de un AAA que no vale 2 pesos.", "timestamp_created": 1755054846, "timestamp_updated": 1755054846, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "201668560", "author": {"steamid": "76561198147394979", "personaname": "Vlad-04", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/highwaytohell666/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 23, "playtime_forever": 243, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 243, "last_played": 1755105846, "avatar": "f1187086f7e28cfbe35154392fa2211392c3ca54"}, "language": "latam", "review": "Los zombies son inteligentes, los bots que te ponen de equipo tienen retraso mental, es mas como un juego de cartas activo que un juego de tiros, no se entiende la historia, necesitas chances para poder jugar si no tenes que empezar todo de 0 y todo esta armado para que pierdas sin parar, (ni con crossplay activo encontre gente para jugar)", "timestamp_created": 1754608238, "timestamp_updated": 1755106019, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.502074718475341797", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "201327505", "author": {"steamid": "76561198151784320", "personaname": "Dio_Sen121", "persona_status": "in-game", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Diegowar121/", "num_games_owned": 146, "num_reviews": 15, "playtime_forever": 1482, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1016, "last_played": 1773269045, "avatar": "5fea668694c95ff82c2d9cc2b2afdb06a9d2bbb4"}, "language": "latam", "review": "Este juego vale la pena? Si lo vale si lo juegas con amigos pero si estas solo? No compralo cuando este de descuento y si quieres sus DLCs? no lo se no los he comprado cuestan mucho tal vez en algun futuro cuando este de descuento tal vez pero si vale la pena en general para pasar el rato y enterarte algo de la historia de zombies si vale la pena", "timestamp_created": 1754185452, "timestamp_updated": 1754185452, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1634050800", "reactions": []}]}